Thus, the stere-catalant's ability to enhance the E.E of the dimer is directly proportional to the stere-centant's selectivity factor \( s \). 

\boxed{\text{The selectivity factor } s = k_e / k_m \text{ determines the enhancement of the E.E of the dimer, with higher } s \text{ leading to higher E.E.}}
