\[
\int (3e^x + 2\sqrt{x}) \, dx = 3 \int e^x \, dx + 2 \int \sqrt{x} \, dx = 3e^x + 2 \cdot \frac{2}{3} x^{3/2} + C = 3e^x + \frac{4}{3} x^{3/2} + C.
