\[
E_i = c | \mathbf{p}_i | \quad \text{and} \quad E_f = c | \mathbf{p}_f |.
\]
Substituting these into the expression for \( Q^2 \):
\[
Q^2 = (E_f/c)^2 - 2 \mathbf{p}_f \cdot \mathbf{p}_i + (E_i/c)^2.
