   \[
   P_A = P_B + P_{\text{weight}}
   \]  
   Solving for \( P_B \):  
   \[
   P_B = P_A - P_{\text{weight}} = 500 \text{ kPa} - 100 \text{ kPa} = 400 \text{ kPa}
   \]  

4. **Adjust for atmospheric pressure**:  
