   P_{\text{gauge}} = 400 \text{ kPa}
   \]  
   The absolute pressure in cylinder B is:  
   \[
   P_{\text{abs}} = 400 \text{ kPa} + 100 \text{ kPa} = 500 \text{ kPa}
   \]  

