V1 = 4 L
V2 = 8 L

Now we can calculate the work done:

W = nRT * ln(V2/V1)
W = (2 mol) * (8.314 J/mol·K) * (T) * ln(8 L / 4 L)
W = 16.62 * T * ln(2)

